WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.672
AI applications still depend on ordinary software components.

2
00:00:03.672 --> 00:00:12.093
Packages, containers, libraries, CI/CD pipelines, cloud services, and infrastructure configurations all introduce risk.

3
00:00:12.093 --> 00:00:23.757
A secure AI system still needs software composition awareness, vulnerability management, patching, secrets management, build integrity, access control, and deployment discipline.

4
00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:27.548
AI does not remove traditional application security requirements.

5
00:00:27.548 --> 00:00:37.067
It adds new layers on top of them, including model artifacts, data pipelines, evaluation assets, prompt templates, and inference services.

6
00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:44.720
Teams should manage AI applications like software systems with additional AI-specific inventory, review, and governance needs.
